fx={Thisworkwas funded by the Spanish Ministry of Economyand Competitiveness (MedShift, CGL2015-71809-P) and the Government of the Balearic Islands (Competitive Group of Excellence GAEM). MAJ acknowledges financial support from the JAE-Doc program (CSIC, cofunded by FSE). We are very grateful to "Finca Publica de Son Real" staff for letting us work in their area and providing logistic support. We also thank Clara Vignolo for help both in the field and lab. Different taxonomists kindly aided us with the identification of the taxa: Lluc Garcia (Isopoda), Xavier Canyelles (Coleoptera), and Dr. Antonio GarciaValdecasas and Dr. Ilse Bartsch (Acari). The study is framed within project CGL-2017-88122-P financed by the Spanish Ministry of Science and Innovation, Spain.},
